#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:5 c190053b0e5845b5b68157ed989dfc8d
msgid "Frame Assembly"
msgstr "机架装配"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:7 b31a73a4115a4beca1c3629608b729e4
msgid ""
"Any servo based Pan & Tilt gimbal should work.  Ideally the system should "
"allow 180 degrees of pan rotation in both directions and 90degrees of pitch "
"both up and down."
msgstr "任何基于舵机的水平 / 俯仰云台都可工作。理想情况下，系统应支持双向 180 度水平旋转以及上下各 90 度俯仰。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:11 d7d3feb5562b41c3b1db565e9606162d
msgid ""
"The servos used can either be regular servos that translate the PWM input "
"into an absolute angle or continuous rotation servos."
msgstr "可以使用普通的舵机（将 PWM 输入转换为绝对角度）也可以使用连续旋转舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:15 5c643b3fdaa74be09883fc365d2831af
msgid "Recommended Frames"
msgstr "推荐机架"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:17 f2bfebc2ee424343b2e970a0620a16d0
msgid "The following have been tested and shown to work:"
msgstr "以下机架已被测试且可用："

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:19 1d3310a9d59c4b10a28f16a864d76133
msgid ""
"`Eagle Eyes Antenna Tracker "
"<http://www.readymaderc.com/store/index.php?main_page=product_info&cPath=11_27&products_id=96>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Eagle Eyes 天线跟踪器 "
"<http://www.readymaderc.com/store/index.php?main_page=product_info&cPath=11_27&products_id=96>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:21 b7c85f177cac43ce998705cd82d310f2
msgid "These systems also likely work:"
msgstr "下面这些系统应该也可用："

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:23 dca8d5b807364665b02c24079ae6db16
msgid ""
"`Servo City PT785-S Pan & Tilt System "
"<http://www.servocity.com/html/pt785-s_pan___tilt_system.html#.U_BL3I8c038>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Servo City PT785-S 水平/俯仰系统 "
"<http://www.servocity.com/html/pt785-s_pan___tilt_system.html#.U_BL3I8c038>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:26 5610bbdcdb37475abfb7c9209e811100
msgid "Mounting the flight controller board"
msgstr "飞控板的安装"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:31 1c66e9dc283442fc8612d29151306485
msgid ""
"The flight controller board should be mounted on the moving part of the "
"antenna tracker."
msgstr "飞控板应安装在天线跟踪器的可动部分上。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:34 7cb09af97a9d451688525d759adedcd6
msgid ""
"If possible align the front of the flight controller so that it points "
"exactly in the direction that the antenna is most sensitive.  So for "
"example, if using a Pixhawk controller and a Yagi antenna, the arrow on the "
"top of the Pixhawk should point in the same direction as the antenna."
msgstr ""
"若条件允许，请把飞控的前向方向与天线的最敏感方向严格对齐。例如使用 Pixhawk 飞控配合 Yagi 天线时，Pixhawk "
"顶面的箭头应指向与天线相同的方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:40 8c3c5b9e7f014a5da5ef7bd94576057d
msgid ""
"Alternatively the flight controller can be mounted at any 45deg or 90deg "
"angle to the antenna and then the AHRS_ORIENTATION parameter can be changed "
"to account for the difference.  :ref:`See the configuration page for more "
"details <configuration_setting_the_ahrs_orientation>`."
msgstr ""
"另外，飞控也可以以任意 45 度或 90 度角安装，然后修改 AHRS_ORIENTATION 参数来补偿方向差异。:ref:`详细说明见配置页面 "
"<configuration_setting_the_ahrs_orientation>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:45 4ed8c505c81a404fab93456a908334d6
msgid "Connecting the servos"
msgstr "舵机的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:50 fa1d290fd347419f9af59f27fcf4d354
msgid ""
"The Pan servo (controls the tracker's heading or yaw) should be connected to"
" RC1, the Tilt servo (controls elevation or pitch) should be connected to "
"RC2. A BEC or ESC should be connected to any of the other RC outputs as "
"shown to provide power for the servos."
msgstr ""
"Pan 舵机（控制跟踪器的航向，即 Yaw）应连接到 RC1；Tilt 舵机（控制仰角，即 Pitch）应连接到 RC2。另外接一个 BEC 或 ESC"
" 到任意一路 RC 输出，为舵机供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:56 953da9a1799c4efcaec5dc4f8967ec65
msgid "Connecting the radio and antenna"
msgstr "电台与天线的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:61 16b3c3361706415e9ed9061f40396539
msgid ""
"The Antenna should be attached to the radio after first removing the radio's"
" di-pole antenna.  Note that the 3DR and RFD900 radios have a RP SMA Male "
"adapter (RP = reverse polarity) while antennas can come with a number of "
"different connectors meaning an adapter (such as `this RP SMA Female to SMA "
"Female adapter "
"<http://www.readymaderc.com/store/index.php?main_page=product_info&cPath=11_45_58&products_id=432>`__)"
" may be required."
msgstr ""
"应先把电台原配的偶极天线拆下，再把外接天线接到电台上。注意 3DR 与 RFD900 电台采用 RP SMA 公头（RP = "
"反向极性），而天线可能配带不同接头——可能需要适配器（例如 `这个 RP SMA 母对 SMA 母适配器 "
"<http://www.readymaderc.com/store/index.php?main_page=product_info&cPath=11_45_58&products_id=432>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:68 c4f6c30206ad44f5ab0d5f9d88a273d0
msgid "Mounting the GPS and external compass"
msgstr "GPS 与外置罗盘的安装"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:70 f7f76ed93f6740159c2dfba5b8eb252a
msgid ""
"If using a GPS+compass module it should be mounted so that the arrow on the "
"module points in the same direction as the antenna. If this is not "
"convenient, the COMPASS_ORIENT parameter can be used to account for this. "
":ref:`See the configuration page for more details "
"<configuration_setting_the_compass_orientation>`.  Care should be taken to "
"ensure the compass is not close to any metal objects."
msgstr ""
"若使用 GPS+罗盘一体化模块，安装时应让模块上的箭头指向与天线相同的方向。若不方便对齐，可使用 COMPASS_ORIENT "
"参数补偿。:ref:`详细说明见配置页面 "
"<configuration_setting_the_compass_orientation>`。请注意罗盘不要靠近金属物体。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-assembly.rst:76 c8d781484c894de097af0bff01bbfcf0
msgid ""
"If using a stand-alone GPS (i.e. not an integrated GPS+compass) the GPS "
"should be positioned so that its antenna has a clear view of the sky. Its "
"heading is not important. Some care should be taken to ensure the cable "
"connected to the flight controller cannot become tangled."
msgstr "若使用独立 GPS（非 GPS+罗盘一体化），GPS 应安装在天线视野开阔的位置。其朝向不重要。请妥善布线，避免与飞控的连接线缠绕。"
